### getUsers
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users

### getUser
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users/2

### createUser
POST http://localhost:4000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rol_id": 1,
    "nombre": "Usuario de Prueba 2",
    "email": "usuario.prueba2@gmail.com",
    "estatus": "desactivado"
}

### updateUser
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/users/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rol_id": 1,
    "nombre": "Usuario de Editado",
    "email": "usuario.editado@gmail.com",
    "estatus": "desactivado"
}

### deleteUser
DELETE  http://localhost:4000/api/users/3

### login (remember = true -> cookie de 30 dias; false/omitido -> cookie de sesion)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "remember": true
}

### me (restaura la sesion al recargar; requiere la cookie del login)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### logout (borra la cookie)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout

### getProfile (requiere la cookie del login)
GET http://localhost:4001/api/profile

### updateProfile (solo se actualiza el correo; los demas campos se ignoran)
PUT http://localhost:4001/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
    "fname": "CAMBIO IGNORADO"
}

### changeUserPassword (solo admin; el id debe ser de OTRO usuario)
PATCH http://localhost:4001/api/admin/users/2/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "newPassword": "nuevaClave123",
    "confirmPassword": "nuevaClave123"
}

### changePassword (requiere la clave actual)
PUT http://localhost:4001/api/profile/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentPassword": "123456",
    "newPassword": "nuevaClave123",
    "confirmPassword": "nuevaClave123"
}